questions.text:
**Shanyraq Web**, a small company in Karaganda, is building a **paid** booking website for a hotel. The developers want to use:

- a photograph of the city from a travel blog — no licence or © sign is shown;
- a map image under a **CC BY-SA** licence;
- a JavaScript calendar under the **GPL** and icons under the **MIT** licence;
- an image editor, bought with **one single-user licence**, which they want to install on all **6** office computers.
